      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FINE TUNE (8) claimed an on-pace win two back then gave a start but got home into the frame when third at this track (25.82). Can go on with it. STARSHIP (6) had the drop on the lead from the rails draw last start but could only manage second, beaten 3.5 lengths (25.52) at this track in a Mix 6/7 over 450m. Expected to be in this for a long way. MISS KIT (7) was well supported last time but could only manage second (25.72), beaten 1.5 lengths. The form out of the last run is proven to be strong. Will give a great sight again. PYRENEES EXPRESS (3) missed the placings here last start but is well-placed to turn the form around.",
